Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 22:23:17 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Respect disable_logs for request diagnostics

server.disable_logs only replaced the request logger, so upstream playback
error messages and the fallback warning that names the requested video
were still written to the log. Skip them when logs are disabled.

Recovery warnings carry no request data and are unchanged.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
---
